<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>ConsentText</key>
    <dict>
        <key>default</key>
        <string>
            ⚠️⚠️⚠️ WARNING – NOT RECOMMENDED FOR ANY USE ⚠️⚠️⚠️

            Profile 5: Complete Apple Service Blocklist

            This profile blocks virtually EVERY Apple service domain known — iCloud, App Store, iMessage, FaceTime, Siri, Maps, push notifications, updates, backups, activation, Find My, Apple Pay, Game Center, News, Weather, Stocks, and more.

            🔴 YOUR DEVICE WILL BECOME ALMOST COMPLETELY NON‑FUNCTIONAL:
            • No iCloud sync, backup, or Drive
            • No App Store or app updates
            • No iMessage or FaceTime
            • No Siri, Maps, Weather, or News
            • No push notifications
            • No software updates
            • No Apple Pay
            • No Find My
            • No device activation (if re‑activated)
            • No certificate validation (same as Profile 1)
            • No analytics, no ads (by accident)

            This profile is provided ONLY for testing, reference, or extreme cases where you intentionally want to disconnect an iOS device from all Apple services. It is NOT recommended for daily use.

            DNS Mobile Configuration By: Wen Zhang
        </string>
    </dict>

